+
+/// Specialization of PredicatedTileIteratorTriangularMatrix for column-major data.
+///
+/// Satisfies: ForwardTileIteratorConcept | 
+///            ReadableContiguousTileIteratorConcept | 
+///            WriteableContiguousTileIteratorConcept |
